&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:18pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;"&gt;(2) 簡便法を適用した制度の、退職給付に係る資産及び負債の期首残高と期末残高の調整表&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:30.1pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
